  "rules": [
    "Personal-name origin components resemble an address and can identify a system/Orbital plus a local subdivision, but do not prove the type of either component.",
    "The -sa suffix is attached to the place-derived component; it roughly corresponds to English -er and is not a prefix.",
    "The first component can identify a stellar system; where a system has only one Orbital, it may instead identify that Orbital.",
    "Known second components include Plates; other second components must remain untyped unless explicitly identified.",
    "The Gzilt Tursensa Ngaroe construction is retained as a separate component-order variation.",
    "Do not infer a Culture Orbital from an adopted Culture name, a birth outside the Culture, or a ship/drone avatar."
